$T=0.58$ is \path{round5/certificate/CERT_T058_M24.json}.
The certificates of Theorem~\ref{thm:index} are archived under \path{scripts/r8a/} of the repository.
The upper certificates of record (Proposition~\ref{prop:haynsworth}) are the eight files
